/* 城镇新支线 8 条 × 3 段 / Setup -> Step2 -> Resolve / 入口：MP Town Extra Stories Hub */
:: MP Town Extra Stories Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
高街布告栏最下面一排多了八张纸条，纸色比旁边的启事新，钉眼却已经生锈。每张纸只写一个地点和一句没头没尾的话，字迹各不相同。你把它们按街角的位置排开，发现正好绕城一圈。
<br><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[裁缝铺里改过三次的礼服 (0:04)|MP Extra Tailor Dress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[医院走廊自己移动的推车 (0:04)|MP Extra Hospital Cart]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[学校天台每天少一只的纸飞机 (0:04)|MP Extra School Planes]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[神殿钟楼每天重系的绳结 (0:04)|MP Extra Temple Bell]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[码头仓库换了朝向的货箱 (0:04)|MP Extra Docks Crate]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[住宅区晾衣绳上的红毛衣 (0:04)|MP Extra Home Line]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[咖啡馆储物间用不完的豆袋 (0:04)|MP Extra Cafe Beans]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[旧钟塔外墙每天多一道刻痕 (0:04)|MP Extra Clock Marks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[铁夹下压着的街巷急报 (0:02)|MP Extra Instant Events Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开布告栏 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Tailor Dress [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set $mpExtraClues to ($mpExtraClues or {})>>
裁缝铺的玻璃门被雨糊住，推门时带进一股湿羊毛的味道。蒸汽熨斗嘶嘶响，熨衣板上的布冒着白气。墙上挂着一排纸样，边角卷起，用大头针别着。衣架最里面挂着一件改过三次的深蓝礼服，腰衬里用粉笔写着三组尺寸。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从侧门离开裁缝铺 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-extra-tailor-dress">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "问裁缝那三组尺寸的来历 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-extra-tailor-dress">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 270>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpExtraClues["tailor_card"] to 1>><span class="green">你用指甲挑开衬布边缘，抽出一张对折的改衣卡。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着新线索继续查探 (0:04)|MP Extra Tailor Dress Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">别针从指腹划过去，血珠落在衬布上，晕成一小点深色。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[定神再试一次 (0:03)|MP Extra Tailor Dress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先按现有线索过去看看 (0:05)|MP Extra Tailor Dress Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "翻柜台下的旧订单簿 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-extra-tailor-dress">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpExtraClues["tailor_card"] to 1>><span class="green">你屏住呼吸顺着器物纹理摸索，没惊动四周便找准了关窍。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|MP Extra Tailor Dress Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">周围的气息让你有些分神，手背蹭上一层灰渍，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:03)|MP Extra Tailor Dress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先按现有线索过去看看 (0:05)|MP Extra Tailor Dress Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Extra Tailor Dress Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set $mpExtraClues to ($mpExtraClues or {})>>
柜台下面的订单簿用布绳捆着，纸页发黄，边缘被手指翻得发毛。你解开绳子，找到同一个姓氏的三张订单。
