	<<set $mpExtraClues["tailor_dates"] to 1>><span class="green">你稳住呼吸沉住气观察片刻，在不起眼的夹缝间看清了端倪。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[带着发现上前印证 (0:04)|MP Extra Tailor Dress Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">冷风吹得你肩头微僵，稍一分神便错过了最佳时机。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:03)|MP Extra Tailor Dress Step2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先按现有线索过去看看 (0:05)|MP Extra Tailor Dress Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
