:: MP Extra Tailor Dress Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_extra_tailor_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpExtraClues to ($mpExtraClues or {})>>
年轻女人推门进来，雨水顺着伞尖滴在地板上。她说自己姓同一个姓，礼服是外婆留下的，家里每办一次舞会就借给下一个要成年的人。轮到她时，舞会已经停办了十几年。
<br><br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 420>>
	你用拆线刀沿着最外层缝线一点点挑开，把原来的折边放出来，再用暗针固定。<<if _first>><<money 800>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<set $mpExtraClues["tailor_fit"] to 1>><<stress -3>>
<<elseif ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	你帮老裁缝把腰线放出半寸，针脚不如她的手稳，但足够撑过一次照相。<<if _first>><<money 400>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你下针太急，最外层缝线崩开一小段。老裁缝没有责怪，只把礼服接过去，说今天先到这里。<<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[把线索钉回布告栏 (0:03)|MP Town Extra Stories Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[把礼服重新挂回衣架 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[再看一眼那三组尺寸 (0:03)|MP Extra Tailor Dress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Hospital Cart [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
<<set $mpExtraClues to ($mpExtraClues or {})>>
凌晨三点十分，住院部旧走廊只剩应急灯亮着。地砖被拖把擦过，还留着一层薄水，鞋底踩上去会轻轻打滑。走廊尽头停着一辆不锈钢推车，轮子有一只磨出了平面，推起来会咯噔一下。扶手上夹着一张写着「6 号床」的卡片，边角盖着护士站的蓝印。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从旧走廊退出去 (0:02)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-extra-hospital-cart">
<<investigateicon>><<link "问护士卡片是谁写的 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-extra-hospital-cart">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>>
	<<set $mpExtraClues["cart_slope"] to 1>><span class="green">你蹲下来看轮子，发现平面正好卡在地砖的接缝里。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着新线索继续查探 (0:04)|MP Extra Hospital Cart Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你伸手去转轮子，推车突然往前一滑，车角撞在小腿上。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[定神再试一次 (0:03)|MP Extra Hospital Cart]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先按现有线索过去看看 (0:05)|MP Extra Hospital Cart Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "沿着推车的路线走一遍 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-extra-hospital-cart">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpExtraClues["cart_slope"] to 1>><span class="green">你顺着旧痕与字迹细细比对，从边角不起眼的折痕里理出了脉络。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|MP Extra Hospital Cart Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你翻找得太急，指腹被粗糙的边角磨得发烫，也没能立刻认出眉目。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:03)|MP Extra Hospital Cart]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先按现有线索过去看看 (0:05)|MP Extra Hospital Cart Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

