傍晚六点，巷子里的灯一盏盏亮起来。一个老太太提着藤篮从巷口走进来，篮子里放着几件叠好的衣服。她走得很慢，每经过一户就抬头看门牌，看很久，再往前走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从巷尾绕出去 (0:02)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-extra-home-line-step2">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "和罗宾一起扶她坐下 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-extra-home-line-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 270>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpExtraClues["line_photo"] to 1>><span class="green">你贴着墙根跟到巷尾，看见她从篮底摸出一张旧照片。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|MP Extra Home Line Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你踩到一片湿树叶，声音在安静的巷子里很响。老太太回过头，把篮子抱紧，退到墙边。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[定神再试一次 (0:03)|MP Extra Home Line Step2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先按现有线索过去看看 (0:05)|MP Extra Home Line Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "低声看她篮底那张旧照片 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-extra-home-line-step2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpExtraClues["line_photo"] to 1>><span class="green">你屏住呼吸顺着器物纹理摸索，没惊动四周便找准了关窍。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[带着发现上前印证 (0:04)|MP Extra Home Line Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">周围的气息让你有些分神，手背蹭上一层灰渍，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再试 (0:03)|MP Extra Home Line Step2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先按现有线索过去看看 (0:05)|MP Extra Home Line Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Extra Home Line Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_extra_home_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpExtraClues to ($mpExtraClues or {})>>
老太太坐在罗宾搬来的木凳上，藤篮放在脚边。她说那件红毛衣是她丈夫的，他以前在码头值夜班，回来时总把毛衣搭在椅背上。
<br><br>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 400>>
	你按照片上的门框样式和窗台的花盆，找到了那扇绿门。<<if _first>><<money 600>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<stress -3>>
<<elseif ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	你陪罗宾把老太太送到巷口，帮她认了认新门牌。<<if _first>><<money 300>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	你在门牌之间看了很久，没能认出照片上的门。<<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[把线索钉回布告栏 (0:03)|MP Town Extra Stories Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[帮罗宾把毛衣收下来 (0:04)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[再看一眼那根晾衣绳 (0:03)|MP Extra Home Line]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Cafe Beans [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $mpExtraClues to ($mpExtraClues or {})>>
咖啡馆储物间的门只有半人高，进去要低头。里面堆着糖浆桶、备用杯碟和几袋面粉，墙角立着一只粗麻布口袋，袋口卷了两折，用一根铜夹夹住。格威岚说这只袋子在储物间放了很久，从没见底。
<br><br>
